WEBVTT

l1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.200
Down the hill and under the bridge

l2
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.400
Where the water runs the colour of tea

l3
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.600
There's a town that don't remember my name

l4
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.800
But the town remembers me

l5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.200
New Mills, New Mills

l6
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:39.400
Say it twice or don't say it at all

l7
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.600
New Mills, New Mills

l8
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.800
I'll be home before the evening falls

l9
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.200
Lead in my hand and mud to the knee

l10
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:04.400
Nobody waiting, nobody but me

l11
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:09.600
And a dog who has never once asked me why

l12
00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:20.000
We take the long way home
